# EL variant overlay — a QUOTED (never asserted) subclass AXIOM. The quoted
# `:C rdfs:subClassOf :D` is a triple TERM: it must not enter the TBox, so the
# classified lattice is byte-identical with or without this overlay and
# :C rdfs:subClassOf :D is never derived.
@prefix : <urn:sparq:qto:> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

:qe rdf:reifies <<( :C rdfs:subClassOf :D )>> .
:qe :certainty "0.9" .
